  "description": "In 1948, the \"liberation period\" was not as free as its name suggests. Hae Ran, a designer who frees customers from their secrets at Gyeongseong Lingerie Shop, the first underwear shop in Joseon, is actually \"Salsu\" who assassinates anti-nationalists every full moon night under the orders of Heukyeong. Hae Ran, who is living a double life, is chased by the police officer Seok Ju one day, and collapses after someone finds out her identity... A warm hand that I feel for the first time in my life. Who was the benefactor that day who healed my wounds and protected me? Meanwhile, Heukyeong infiltrates the office disguised as a designer who studied abroad in order to keep an eye on Salsu. But the two of them end up harboring feelings for each other…\n\n*\"Was our relationship… the key to escaping the cage? Or was it the shackles that bound us?\"*\n\nA love triangle of liberation between three youths who chased each other’s tails to escape their cages.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
